          <span class="step-path">Meta: Events Manager &rarr; Test Events &rarr; look for Purchase, source: server<br>Google: Ads &rarr; Goals &rarr; Conversions &rarr; your purchase action &rarr; Diagnostics<br>TikTok: Events Manager &rarr; Test Events &rarr; look for CompletePayment</span>
          Check that each purchase shows once, with the order&rsquo;s real value. If not, see the Troubleshooting section below.
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
